// Grafana Alloy pipeline config for the devshard testenv.
//
// Phase 13; see devshard/docs/testenv.md §Phase 13.
//
// This file is the single-source Alloy config applied to the alloy
// container. It will be populated during Phase 13 with:
//
//   * prometheus.scrape  — scrape devshardd-testenv-*:9100/metrics,
//                          cAdvisor, Node Exporter
//   * prometheus.remote_write — push to VictoriaMetrics
//   * loki.source.docker — collect container stdout
//   * loki.write          — push to Loki
//
// Intentionally empty until Phase 13 lands; commented-out skeleton is
// preserved to make review diffs small.

